r compliance\",\n      \"explanation\": \"The alignment of Artigo 32 with RIPD and its associated tools suggests a strategic emphasis on proactive risk assessment and standardization across public-sector institutions. This structure implies that compliance requires ongoing risk evaluations, timely preparation of RIPDs, and adherence to established standards and best practices. The core relationships show that Artigo 32 enables proactive actions and RIPD implements those actions, shaping governance and compliance expectations. [Data: Entities (91); Relationships (109,111)].\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"rating\": 6.5,\n  \"rating_explanation\": \"The impact severity rating reflects the regulatory significance of Artigo 32 and RIPD in shaping mandatory proactive data protection actions and standards, with substantial consequences for public-sector compliance.\"\n}"}, "metrics": {"attempted_request_count": 1, "successful_response_count": 0, "failed_response_count": 0, "responses_with_tokens": 1, "prompt_tokens": 2884, "completion_tokens": 7511, "total_tokens": 10395, "compute_duration_seconds": 36.90832304954529, "streaming_responses": 0, "retries": 0, "requests_with_retries": 0}}}